SUMMARY:“Startup Incorporation: The What\, When\, & How” with Alan Single
 ton
TZID:America/Chicago
CREATED:20250506T010000Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260919T010000Z
DESCRIPTION:Registration Required: https://forms.illinois.edu/sec/8365742
 57 Do you find yourself unsure about the right business entity type to c
 onsider for your startup? Do you often get conflicting guidance about ho
 w to select the right one? Join Alan Singleton\, President of Singleton 
 Law Firm\, to learn about the various entity types and how to think abou
 t them depending on the business type and stage. Alan is an Entrepreneur
  in Residence at EnterpriseWorks with over 25 years of experience of exp
 erience guiding entrepreneurs through the legal aspects of launching and
  growing businesses. Lunch provided. 
LOCATION:EnterpriseWorks\, 60 Hazelwood Drive
CATEGORIES:Conference/Workshop
CONTACT:Cathy McArthur
ORGANIZER:mcarthur@illinois.edu
