DESCRIPTION:Research Park is excited to offer our community an on-site Fl
 u Shot Clinic on Wednesday\, October 7 from 2:30 to 3:30 p.m. This is op
 en to the entire Research Park community. Quantities may be limited\, so
  it will be first come\, first served. Thank you to Hudson Drug Shop for
  providing this service to the Research Park community. What to bring: P
 lease bring a PHARMACY insurance card (not all health insurance cards ha
 ve pharmacy info on them). Want to speed up the process? Download the va
 ccination form from the website here:  www.hudsondrugshop.com * Forms wi
 ll be available on-site Who is eligible: Flu shots will be available for
  anyone age 7 and older while supplies last\; COVID vaccine is available
  to those age 12 and older. Cost: Shots are billed to insurance.Question
 s? Contact Cathy McArthur at mcarthur@illinois.edu 
